Memory Leak Fix (Itamio Forge port for Minecraft 1.20.1)

This mod is an unofficial port of "Memory Leak Fix" by FX
(https://github.com/fxmorin/memoryLeakFix, LGPL-2.1-only, 38.8M
downloads on Modrinth, max Minecraft 1.20.4).

All credit for the original concept, design, and logic goes to FX.
This port was created by Itamio to bring the mod to Minecraft
1.20.1 (Forge).

Itamio does not take credit for any of the original assets or logic.
The code was updated to be compatible with Minecraft 1.20.1 (Forge).
Port status: biome temperature ThreadLocal, TextureUtil free
buffer (MC-226729), and crosshair target clear fixes were ported.
The TagKey interner fix (MC-248621) was not ported because TagKey
was rewritten in 1.20.1. The entity memories fix (MC-260605)
was not ported because vanilla fixed it in 1.19.4, the drowned
navigation fix targeted 1.16.3-1.16.5 only, and the huge screenshot
fix needs MixinExtras. See README for the per-fix breakdown.
